# Never commit the student's own data.
#
# state/ holds the report, a copy of the portfolio, the scan cache, the scan history
# and THE API KEY in plain text. Publishing it would leak all of it, and a key in a
# public repository is scraped within minutes.
state/

# Built packages are uploaded as release assets, not committed. Each is ~31 MB, and
# git keeps every version forever, so committing them would bloat the repository in a
# way that cannot be undone.
dist/

# Node runtimes: 104 MB (macOS) and 79 MB (Windows). They ship inside the release zip.
# The Windows binary is fetched by tools/package.sh, so it is reproducible.
runtime/

# macOS noise.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Dropbox/Drive conflict copies of state files, which have previously contained a key.
*conflicted copy*
